{"id":"0c49ab96b42ba7d4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTBoundRow.md","title":"MTBoundRow","display":"MTBoundRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MTBoundRow","parameters":["z1650","z1651","z1652"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MTBoundRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1650</span><span>z1651</span><span>z1652</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>z1650</code>、<code>z1651</code>、<code>z1652</code>。</p>\n<p>约束类型中的元变量指标严格小于 n；基类型标签为自然数。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MTBoundRow z1650 z1651 z1652)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists n\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair n t z1652)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat n)\n        (or\n          (exists z1655 (and (@ Nat z1655) (@ TBase z1655 t)))\n          (or\n            (exists z1655 (and (in z1655 n) (@ CMeta z1655 t)))\n            (exists z1656\n              (exists z1657\n                (and\n                  (@ TArr z1656 z1657 t)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z1658\n                      (exists z1659 (and (in z1658 z1651) (and (@ App z1650 z1658 z1659) (@ Pair n z1656 z1659)))))\n                    (exists z1660\n                      (exists z1661 (and (in z1660 z1651) (and (@ App z1650 z1660 z1661) (@ Pair n z1657 z1661)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0bad47202596d03\" href=\"?note=b0bad47202596d03\" title=\"ZFC_CMeta\">CMeta</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b30f1eee99e1c728\" href=\"?note=b30f1eee99e1c728\" title=\"ZFC_TBase\">TBase</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MTBoundRow z1650 z1651 z1652)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CMeta|CMeta]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CMeta","status":"resolved","id":"b0bad47202596d03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CMeta|CMeta]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_C